    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539-a3">

                <pb facs="0604" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg554"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 11.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Peirce to Mr.
                            Rawicz.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic">October 24,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the death from pneumonia of
                    Stanislaus Krzeminski in the examination prison at Warsaw, you will please visit
                    the prison, and if possible inspect the cell or other apartment or room in which
                    the said Krzeminski was incarcerated, with a view to ascertaining, if you can,
                    whether the disease was induced by exposure owing to the manner of his treatment
                    during confinement, and report.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert H. D.
                    Peirce.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
